extDescription:
Once per turn: You can discard 1 card, then activate 1 of these effects;
<br>• Add 1 Level 4 or lower "Dragunity" monster from your Deck to your hand.
<br>• Send 1 Dragon-Type monster from your Deck to the Graveyard.

